{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488470/extras/politon_wishlist.png?t=1738007710\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Politon:</strong> A turn-based strategy game that will push your strategic and management skills to the limit! Expand your territory, strengthen your economy, and outsmart your enemies by planning your strategy carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Unique Experience for Strategy Enthusiasts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Manage your resources wisely, predict your enemies' moves, and outmaneuver them to achieve victory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge opponents in online multiplayer battles or delve into Politon\u2019s story in the single-player campaign. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488470/extras/politon.gif?t=1738007710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world filled with evolving threats and opportunities with every move you make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Forge Your Own Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rely on military power or diplomacy to achieve your goals? The choice is entirely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Politon, strategy is your greatest weapon! Face your rivals and carve your name into history! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488470/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1738007710\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Competitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2488470/13b129ac7657f84196bcb0c27cf2c7